# CareOps — Unified Operations Platform — Implementation Plan

This plan covers a full-stack platform with a **Next.js 14+ frontend** and a **FastAPI backend**, communicating via REST APIs, with **PostgreSQL** as the database.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Scope Caveat**: This is a single-developer implementation. Third-party integrations (Twilio, Resend, Google Calendar, S3, Supabase Auth) will be **stubbed with placeholders** — the architecture is wired for them, but live API keys are not configured. The focus is on a **fully functional local demo** with real database, real UI, and real business logic.

---

