## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1: Frontend Scaffolding

#### [NEW] frontend/ (entire Next.js project)

- Initialize via `npx create-next-app@latest` with TypeScript, TailwindCSS, App Router
- Install ShadCN UI, TanStack Query, Zustand, Lucide icons
- Create the app layout with sidebar navigation and responsive shell
- Design system: dark/light mode, color palette, typography (Inter font)

Key files:
- `src/app/layout.tsx` — root layout with providers (QueryClient, theme)
- `src/components/ui/` — ShadCN components (Button, Card, Input, Dialog, Table, etc.)
- `src/components/layout/sidebar.tsx` — main navigation sidebar
- `src/lib/api.ts` — API client wrapper with base URL config
- `src/lib/auth.ts` — auth utilities (token storage, guards)
- `src/stores/auth-store.ts` — Zustand auth state

---

### Phase 2: Backend Scaffolding & Database

#### [NEW] backend/ (entire FastAPI project)

- Python project with FastAPI, SQLAlchemy 2.0, Alembic, Pydantic v2
- Layered architecture: API → Service → Repository → DB

Key files:
- `app/main.py` — FastAPI app with CORS, lifespan, router mounts
- `app/config.py` — Settings (DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET, etc.)
- `app/database.py` — async SQLAlchemy engine + session dependency
- `app/models/` — All 14 SQLAlchemy models (users, workspaces, contacts, conversations, messages, bookings, booking_types, forms, form_submissions, inventory_items, alerts, integrations, automation_events, staff_roles)
- `app/schemas/` — Pydantic schemas per model
- `app/api/v1/` — Route files per module
- `app/services/` — Business logic per module
- `app/repositories/` — DB query layer per model

#### [NEW] alembic/ — Database migrations

- Initial migration with all 14 tables
- Relationships: workspace → contacts → conversations → messages, workspace → bookings, etc.

---

### Phase 3: Auth Module

#### Backend
- `app/api/v1/auth.py` — `/register`, `/login`, `/me` endpoints
- `app/services/auth_service.py` — password hashing (bcrypt), JWT token generation
- `app/lib/security.py` — JWT encode/decode, `get_current_user` dependency

#### Frontend
- `src/app/(auth)/login/page.tsx` — login page with form
- `src/app/(auth)/register/page.tsx` — registration page
- `src/app/(auth)/layout.tsx` — auth layout (centered card)
- `src/lib/auth.ts` — token management, auth guard middleware

---

### Phase 4: Workspace Onboarding

#### Backend
- `app/api/v1/workspaces.py` — CRUD + activation endpoint
- `app/api/v1/onboarding.py` — step tracking
- `app/services/onboarding_service.py` — validation logic for each step

#### Frontend
- `src/app/(dashboard)/onboarding/page.tsx` — 8-step wizard UI
- `src/components/onboarding/step-*.tsx` — individual step components
- Multi-step form with progress indicator, validation per step

---

### Phase 5: Unified Inbox

#### Backend
- `app/api/v1/contacts.py` — contact CRUD
- `app/api/v1/conversations.py` — conversation list + messages
- `app/api/v1/messages.py` — send/receive messages
- WebSocket endpoint for real-time message updates

#### Frontend
- `src/app/(dashboard)/inbox/page.tsx` — 3-column inbox (contacts / conversation / detail)
- `src/components/inbox/conversation-list.tsx`
- `src/components/inbox/message-thread.tsx`
- `src/components/inbox/compose-message.tsx`
- WebSocket hook for live updates

---

### Phase 6: Booking Management

#### Backend
- `app/api/v1/bookings.py` — CRUD + state transitions
- `app/api/v1/booking_types.py` — service type config
- `app/services/booking_service.py` — availability check, calendar stub

#### Frontend
- `src/app/(dashboard)/bookings/page.tsx` — staff booking dashboard
- `src/app/book/[slug]/page.tsx` — public booking page (no auth)
- `src/components/bookings/booking-calendar.tsx`
- `src/components/bookings/booking-form.tsx`

---

### Phase 7: Forms Management

#### Backend
- `app/api/v1/forms.py` — CRUD for form definitions
