#### Frontend
- `src/app/(dashboard)/forms/page.tsx` — form list + builder
- `src/components/forms/form-builder.tsx`
- `src/components/forms/form-renderer.tsx`

---

### Phase 8: Inventory Module

#### Backend
- `app/api/v1/inventory.py` — CRUD + threshold alerts

#### Frontend
- `src/app/(dashboard)/inventory/page.tsx` — inventory dashboard
- `src/components/inventory/item-table.tsx`
- `src/components/inventory/alert-card.tsx`

---

### Phase 9: Dashboard

#### Backend
- `app/api/v1/dashboard.py` — aggregated stats endpoint

#### Frontend
- `src/app/(dashboard)/dashboard/page.tsx` — main dashboard
- `src/components/dashboard/booking-overview.tsx`
- `src/components/dashboard/leads-summary.tsx`
- `src/components/dashboard/forms-tracker.tsx`
- `src/components/dashboard/inventory-alerts.tsx`
- `src/components/dashboard/alerts-panel.tsx`

---

### Phase 10: Automation Engine

#### Backend
- `app/api/v1/automations.py` — automation config + logs
- `app/services/automation_engine.py` — event listener + action dispatcher
- Event hooks wired into booking, contact, form, and inventory services

